      [32m'</ul>\n'[39m +
      [32m'\n'[39m +
      [32m'<h3>Class Structure</h3>\n'[39m +
      [32m'<ul>\n'[39m +
      [32m'<li>45 minutes: Safety theory and communication fundamentals</li>\n'[39m +
      [32m'<li>90 minutes: Hands-on practice with instructor guidance</li>\n'[39m +
      [32m'<li>30 minutes: Q&A and resource sharing</li>\n'[39m +
      [32m'<li>15 minutes: Community discussion and next steps</li>\n'[39m +
      [32m'</ul>\n'[39m +
      [32m'\n'[39m +
      [32m'<p>This class emphasizes building a strong foundation in safety practices that will serve you throughout your rope journey. We focus on understanding risks, developing good habits, and creating positive experiences for all participants.</p>'[39m,
