ion\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">🎭</div><h3 class=\"m_8a5d1357 mantine-Title-root\" data-order=\"3\" style=\"--title-fw: var(--mantine-h3-font-weight); --title-lh: var(--mantine-h3-line-height); --title-fz: var(--mantine-h3-font-size); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-burgundy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Expert Teaching</h3><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\" style=\"color: var(--color-charcoal); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px;\">Learn from experienced instructors who make rope accessible to everyone. We blend technical skills with creativity and always prioritize safety.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\"><div class=\"feature-icon-animation\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">🌹</div><h3 class=\"m_8a5d1357 mantine-Title-root\" data-order=\"3\" style=\"--title-fw: var(--mantine-h3-font-weight); --title-lh: var(--mantine-h3-line-height); --title-fz: var(--mantine-h3-font-size); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-burgundy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Welcoming Community</h3><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\" style=\"color: var(--color-charcoal); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px;\">Find your people in our warm, respectful space. We celebrate diversity, honor boundaries, and support each other's growth.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\"><div class=\"feature-icon-animation\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">🔮</div><h3 class=\"m_8a5d1357 mantine-Title-root\" data-order=\"3\" style=\"--title-fw: var(--mantine-h3-font-weight); --title-lh: var(--mantine-h3-line-height); --title-fz: var(--mantine-h3-font-size); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-burgundy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Safety First, Always</h3><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\" style=\"color: var(--color-charcoal); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px;\">We're committed to risk-aware practice, ongoing consent, and creating an environment where everyone feels secure to learn and explore.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\"><div class=\"feature-icon-animation\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">✨</div><h3 class=\"m_8a5d1357 mantine-Title-root\" data-order=\"3\" style=\"--title-fw: var(--mantine-h3-font-weight); --title-lh: var(--mantine-h3-line-height); --title-fz: var(--mantine-h3-font-size); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-burgundy); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Everyone Belongs</h3><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\" style=\"color: var(--color-charcoal); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px;\">All bodies, orientations, and experience levels are welcome here. Come as you are—we're excited to support your unique journey.</p></div></div></section><style data-mantine-styles=\"inline\">@media(min-width: 48em){.__m__-r49{padding-top:var(--space-2xl);padding-bottom:var(--space-2xl);}}</style><section class=\"cta-section __m__-r49\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding-inline: calc(2.5rem * var(--mantine-scale));\"><div class=\"\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-burgundy-dark) 0%, var(--color-midnight) 100%); color: var(--color-ivory); padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl); text-align: center; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0px auto; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 20px 60px; border-radius: 16px;\"><div class=\"cta-rotate-animation\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='100' height='100' viewBox='0 0 100 100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%